OL,3,AAt least 21 killed after vehicle loaded
OL,4,Awith explosives rams Pakistan mosque
OL,5,
OL,6,FA car-bomb attack on a mosque at a
OL,7,Fpolice compound in north-western
OL,8,FPakistan has killed at least 21 people
OL,9,Fand injured more than 100, officials
OL,10,Fsay.
OL,12,FFifteen police officers and a
OL,13,Ffour-year-old child are among those
OL,14,Fkilled in the suicide attack, which
OL,15,Falso involved gunmen firing on the
OL,16,Fpolice facility in the city of Kohat in
OL,17,Fthe province of Khyber Pakhtunkhwa,
OL,18,FPakistan's APP news agency reported.
OL,20,FVideo found by BBC Verify shows the
OL,21,Fsite covered in rubble and people
OL,22,Ftending to casualties.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,317,300,200,140,0,100
