OL,5,
OL,6,FKhyber Pakhtunkhwa Police suggested a
OL,7,Ffaction of the Tehrik-e-Taliban
OL,8,FPakistan (TTP), also known as the
OL,9,FPakistani Taliban, carried out the
OL,10,Fattack.
